<p style="font-family: Calibri, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 24pt; font-variant: normal; margin: 0pt;"><a id="prin_shares" href="#"></a><span style="color:#00a64d;">PRINCIPAL SHAREHOLDERS</span></p>

<p style="font-family: Calibri, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 10pt; font-variant: normal; margin: 0pt;">&#160;</p>

<p style="font-family: Calibri, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 10pt; font-variant: normal; margin: 0pt;">Persons and groups beneficially owning more than five percent of First Northwest&#8217;s outstanding shares of common stock (&#8220;5% Beneficial Owners&#8221;) are required to file reports with the Securities and Exchange Commission (the &#8220;SEC&#8221;) disclosing their ownership. The following table lists all 5% Beneficial Owners known to management as of the record date for the Annual Meeting, March&#160;20, 2026 (the &#8220;Record Date&#8221;):</p>

<p style="font-family: Calibri, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 10pt; font-variant: normal; margin: 0pt;">&#160;</p>

