			<p style="margin: 0pt; text-align: left; font-family: Calibri, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 8pt;">Based solely on information contained in the Form 13F filed on February 13, 2026, reporting investment discretion as to all shares by Fourthstone LLC.</p>
