			</td>
			<td style="width: auto; font-family: Calibri, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 8pt;">
			<p style="margin: 0pt; text-align: left; font-family: Calibri, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 8pt;">As of September 30, 2024, the employee stock ownership plan (&#8220;ESOP&#8221;) had sole voting power as to 608,855 shares, shared voting power as to 299,927 shares, and shared dispositive power as to 908,782 shares. The ESOP provides for pass-through voting as to shares allocated to ESOP participants. The trustee for the ESOP will vote all shares as to which participants have not provided voting instructions in the same proportions as the shares as to which the trustee received timely instructions from participants.</p>
			</td>
		</tr>
