			<p style="margin: 0pt; text-align: left; font-family: Calibri, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 8pt;">Based solely on information contained in the Form 13G filed on February 5, 2026, reporting sole voting and dispositive power as to all shares by FMR LLC.</p>
			</td>
