			<p style="font-family: Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 10pt; font-variant: normal; margin: 0pt 0pt 0pt 19pt; text-indent: -14pt;"><span style="color:#00a64d;">&#8226;</span>&#160;&#160;&#160;&#160;Nom and Corp Governance (Chair)</p>

			<p style="font-family: Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 10pt; font-variant: normal; margin: 0pt 0pt 0pt 19pt; text-indent: -14pt;"><span style="color:#00a64d;">&#8226;</span>&#160;&#160;&#160;&#160;Loan and Asset Quality (FF)</p>

