			<p style="margin: 0pt; text-align: left; font-family: Calibri, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 8pt;"><sup style="vertical-align:top;line-height:120%;">1 </sup></p>
			</td>
			<td style="width: auto; font-family: Calibri, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 8pt;">
			<p style="margin: 0pt; text-align: left; font-family: Calibri, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 8pt;">During the year ended December 31, 2025, the Board approved an additional retainer of $400 per month to each member of the Executive Committee and a further additional retainer of $390 per month to the Chair of the Executive Committee. The Board also approved one-time payments of $20,000 to Ms. Finnie and $15,000 to each of Ms. Anderson, Mr. Brennan, Mr. Galanda, and Mr. Tonina in recognition of additional services provided in connection with the management transition. These amounts are reflected, as applicable, in this column.</p>
			</td>
		</tr>

</tbody></table>

<table border="0" cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0" style="width: 100%; text-indent: 0px; font-family: Calibri, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 8pt;">

