			<td style="width: 9pt; font-family: Calibri, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 8pt;">&#160;</td>
			<td style="width: 9pt; font-family: Calibri, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 8pt;">
			<p style="margin: 0pt; text-align: left; font-family: Calibri, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 8pt;"><sup style="vertical-align:top;line-height:120%;">2</sup></p>
			</td>
			<td style="width: auto; font-family: Calibri, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 8pt;">
			<p style="margin: 0pt; text-align: left; font-family: Calibri, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 8pt;">The dollar amounts shown in the table represent the aggregate grant date fair value of awards, computed in accordance with Financial Accounting Standards Board Accounting Standards Codification Topic 718, &#8220;Compensation &#8211; Stock Compensation&#8221; (&#8220;FASB ASC Topic 718&#8221;) based on the closing price of First Northwest&#8217;s common stock on the respective date of grant in 2025. The restricted shares held by each director on December 31, 2025, were as follows: Ms. Bartee, 6,990 shares; Mr. Brennan, 6,955 shares; Ms. Davis, 7,042 shares; Ms. Terwoerds, 3,293 shares; and Ms. Anderson, Mr. Behar, Ms. Finnie, and Mr. Galanda, 2,219 shares.</p>
			</td>
		</tr>

</tbody></table>

