			<p style="margin: 0pt; text-align: left; font-family: Calibri, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 8pt;">Includes cash dividends earned on unvested shares of restricted stock which were paid upon vesting under the First Northwest Bancorp 2020 Equity Incentive Plan.</p>
