			</td>
			<td style="width: auto;">
			<p style="margin: 0pt; text-align: left; font-family: Calibri, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 8pt;">Represents the aggregate grant date fair value of time-based and performance-based awards granted in the calendar year, computed in accordance with FASB ASC Topic 718 based on the closing price of First Northwest&#8217;s common stock on the respective date of grant in 2025.The payout of the Performance Share Awards (&#8220;PSAs&#8221;) depends on the probable outcome of the performance criteria on the award certification date. Only Messrs. Edelstein and Henderson received PSAs in 2025. For those PSAs, assuming that the highest level of performance condition will be achieved, the grant date fair value for the maximum awards would be as follows: for Mr. Edelstein $50,524&#160;and for Mr. Henderson $37,707.</p>
			</td>
		</tr>

</tbody></table>

<table border="0" cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0" style="width: 100%; text-indent: 0px;">

		<tbody><tr style="vertical-align: top;">
