			</td>
			<td style="width: auto;">
			<p style="margin: 0pt; text-align: left; font-family: Calibri, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 8pt;">Reflects amounts earned under the Cash Incentive Plan in the calendar year. The material terms of the Cash Incentive Plan for 2025 are described below under &#8220;Cash Incentive Compensation.&#8221;</p>
			</td>
		</tr>

</tbody></table>

<table border="0" cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0" style="width: 100%; text-indent: 0px;">

