<p style="font-family: Calibri, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 10pt; font-variant: normal; margin: 0pt;">&#160;</p>

<p style="font-family: Calibri, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 26pt; font-variant: normal; margin: 0pt;"><a id="audit_comm" href="#"></a><span style="color:#00a64d;">AUDIT COMMITTEE REPORT</span></p>

