			<p style="margin: 0pt; text-align: left; font-family: Calibri, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 10pt;">the Audit Committee has completed its review and discussion with management of the audited financial statements for the year ended December 31, 2025;</p>
			</td>
		</tr>

</tbody></table>

<p style="font-family: Calibri, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 10pt; font-variant: normal; margin: 0pt;">&#160;</p>

