		</tr>
		<tr style="vertical-align: bottom; font-family: Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 8pt;">
			<td style="font-family: Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 8pt; border-bottom: 1px solid rgb(0, 0, 0); width: 46%;">
			<p style="font-family: Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 8pt; font-variant: normal; margin: 0pt;">Audit fees</p>
			</td>
			<td style="width: 1%; font-family: Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 8pt; border-bottom: 1px solid rgb(0, 0, 0);">&#160;</td>
			<td style="width: 25%; font-family: Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 8pt; margin-left: 0pt; border-bottom: 1px solid rgb(0, 0, 0); text-align: center;">$663,000</td>
			<td style="width: 1%; font-family: Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 8pt; border-bottom: 1px solid rgb(0, 0, 0); margin-left: 0pt;">&#160;</td>
			<td style="width: 1%; font-family: Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 8pt; border-bottom: 1px solid rgb(0, 0, 0);">&#160;</td>
			<td style="width: 25%; font-family: Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 8pt; margin-left: 0pt; border-bottom: 1px solid rgb(0, 0, 0); text-align: center;">$665,189</td>
			<td style="width: 1%; font-family: Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 8pt; border-bottom: 1px solid rgb(0, 0, 0); margin-left: 0pt;">&#160;</td>
		</tr>
		<tr style="vertical-align: bottom; font-family: Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 8pt;">
			<td style="font-family: Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 8pt; border-bottom: 1px solid rgb(0, 0, 0); width: 46%;">
			<p style="font-family: Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 8pt; font-variant: normal; margin: 0pt;">Audit-related fees</p>
			</td>
			<td style="width: 1%; font-family: Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 8pt; border-bottom: 1px solid rgb(0, 0, 0);">&#160;</td>
			<td style="width: 25%; font-family: Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 8pt; margin-left: 0pt; border-bottom: 1px solid rgb(0, 0, 0); text-align: center;">$47,100</td>
			<td style="width: 1%; font-family: Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 8pt; border-bottom: 1px solid rgb(0, 0, 0); margin-left: 0pt;">&#160;</td>
			<td style="width: 1%; font-family: Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 8pt; border-bottom: 1px solid rgb(0, 0, 0);">&#160;</td>
			<td style="width: 25%; font-family: Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 8pt; margin-left: 0pt; border-bottom: 1px solid rgb(0, 0, 0); text-align: center;">$48,300</td>
			<td style="width: 1%; font-family: Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 8pt; border-bottom: 1px solid rgb(0, 0, 0); margin-left: 0pt;">&#160;</td>
		</tr>
		<tr style="vertical-align: bottom; font-family: Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 8pt;">
			<td style="font-family: Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 8pt; border-bottom: 1px solid rgb(0, 0, 0); width: 46%;">
			<p style="font-family: Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 8pt; font-variant: normal; margin: 0pt;">Tax fees</p>
			</td>
