			</td>
			<td style="border-bottom: 1px solid rgb(0, 0, 0); vertical-align: middle; width: 52.3%; font-family: Calibri, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 9pt;">
			<p style="font-family: Calibri, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 9pt; font-variant: normal; text-align: center; margin: 0pt 0pt 0pt 5pt;">An advisory (non-binding) vote to approve the compensation of our named executive officers, as disclosed in this Proxy Statement; and</p>
			</td>
