			<p style="font-family: &quot;Calibri&quot;, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 10pt; font-variant: normal; margin: 0pt 0pt 0pt 27pt; text-align: left;">1.1 <span style="color: rgb(255, 0, 0); font-family: Calibri, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 10pt;"><span style="color:#ff0000;"><span style="text-decoration: line-through; ">Establishment</span></span><span style="text-decoration: underline; ">Adoption</span></span></p>
